================================================================================
PRETRAINED WEIGHTS
================================================================================

G-CBM uses CNN backbones whose architectures and default ImageNet-pretrained
checkpoints are provided by third-party libraries (not redistributed here).
Weights are downloaded by the user at runtime and remain subject to their
upstream terms. This repository does not vendor .pt / .pth weight files.

  - ResNet-50, DenseNet-201, MobileNet-V2 — via torchvision
    (see torchvision / PyTorch licences in requirements.txt and sbom/).
    Default checkpoints use torchvision Weights enums (ImageNet-1K).

Fine-tuned checkpoints produced by train_cnn (e.g. {dataset}_{backbone}_cnn.pt)
are user-generated artefacts derived from those backbones; they are not shipped
in this repository.

ImageNet-trained weights are distinct from the ImageNet *dataset* terms above:
the G-CBM *source code* remains Apache-2.0, but use of ImageNet-derived weights
may still be constrained by upstream weight and dataset policies. Obtain and
use weights only under terms you accept.

